"tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Como se diz por aqui: \"se chove é porque vai chover\".","e":"As we say, if it's raining it's going to rain!","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.667111,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"eeef1858aa18f2b4a8dc4a4bfe148406","i":"8bf5249925e6f162ae740d78ecdbdf13","r":"5555502:6839940:165 166:3828260","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5555502","6839940","165 166"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mas escutem, há coisas importantes no mundo e chove na floresta.","e":"But, listen, there's important things going on in the world, it's raining in the forest.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.867202,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"5951dc8da7415ab857d2424ccba877b7","i":"99838b98bdde8a306025ed36bac21c4d","r":"6878486:7040267:748:5259053","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6878486","7040267","748"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mas a terapia não tirou a desconfortável sensação que tenho quando chove.","e":"But the therapy did not remove the uncomfortable feeling that I have for rain.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.89829,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"873390698720deaf862a53f801ed5c71","i":"9edda572efde53d4eca9e56e07785b34","r":"4217236:6271971:312:1098656","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4217236","6271971","312"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Aqui chove muito no verão, mas, por outro lado, no inverno chove pouco.","e":"We have much rain in summer but on the other hand we have little rain in winter.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.897682,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"e7f7266aa9dbb6db5c8b82fd49ca1c85","i":"ad03658c5820f3111818130f68a25b86","r":"3061812:24379","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3061812","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3061812","b":"Tatoeba sentence #3061812 by carlosalberto; English translation #24379 by papabear","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3061812","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Por isso se me preparar para chuva, então não chove.","e":"So if I prepare for rain, then it won't.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.8685,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"68b9d743c6997e768b32fc0339f8cbe1","i":"ec9ab71e07e88934608682c316c6de51","r":"787524:6721928:588:2213836","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["787524","6721928","588"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"E cada vez que chove, elas dormem molhadas.","e":"And every time it rains, they sleep wet.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.902314,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a7a5cba3ec95a51f19b27d390326ea51","i":"557093721bf867fcb3cbc48d31377e3e","r":"4056738:6289561:542:836939","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4056738","6289561","542"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Quando está calor, eu vou nadar. Quando chove, eu gosto de jogar xadrez.","e":"When it's hot, I go swim. When it rains, I like to play chess.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.874772,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b9385ce37b2b0d5bf3ba930b6f8ee8a9","i":"12f0a915d87f7a4f0a8b2a62a246fde3","r":"899737:687534","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/899737","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/899737","b":"Tatoeba sentence #899737 by alexmarcelo; English translation #687534 by lukaszpp","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/899737","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Chove assim em Bombaim, mas não faz tanto frio.","e":"It rains like this in Bombay... but it's not so cold there.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.857871,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"e918d52529e344ec40b2e6a494af6353","i":"e48314b4452c44d360c24509fff3da6f","r":"3852470:6356157:395:630898","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3852470","6356157","395"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Deste lado da montanha, não chove muito.","e":"On this side of the mountain, it doesn't rain much.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.893973,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"66f91d8f0a2f28c9045bd44bac11669d","i":"10ebcca46150afe205967e1a0c1c2b84","r":"5236938:5236545","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5236938","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5236938","b":"Tatoeba sentence #5236938 by carlosalberto; English translation #5236545 by AlanF_US","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5236938","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"A nuvem tem uma covinha Há água na covinha E chove","e":"The cloud has a dimple, There's water in the dimple, and it rains down\" Tap, 'cap, tap","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.730679,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"09045b6a12b72d49d8c60c5b30514680","i":"c47d4a5715882fe8c24c1019fa8caa66","r":"4909752:7049535:427 428:4434076","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4909752","7049535","427 428"],"w":["leaf",0]}]]}}}